      propertyPath: _additionalText
      value: 'I can feel it now, under my skin. Like my bones are trying to crawl
        out. I saw Jenkins in the hallway, or at least what''s left of him. I tried
        to do the right thing, I locked the circuit room before I got too far gone.
        The console still needs clearance. Keycard''s somewhere in here, I was using
        it as a bookmark. Reading always did calm my nerves. Don''t come looking
        for me. If I''m not me anymore, you won''t find what you''re looking for
        anyways.

        -Morano'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8872741453040617530, guid: 3343a3afc05174c41a99c6d218f545bf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
