    - target: {fileID: 8118185164639072151, guid: de0c515be4fde374dac2bc88d24d6e98, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _additionalText
      value: 'I didn''t know what else to do. I dragged what I could - barrels, crates,
        anything to keep them out. If you need to get through, shoot the barrels.
        It might draw them out, but it''s better than staying trapped in here. Just...be
        ready if you do.

        -Jenkins'
